The copy in this folder is the upstream file with some whole lines
removed and nothing else changed: tools/update_styles.py drops every line
holding a word listed (as a sha256 digest) in tools/style-denylist.txt.
The removed lines are a provider's comment block and its suffix rules; the
unmodified list is available at the URL above, under the same licence.

